<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="lt">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" sizes="16x16 32x32 48x48">
<title><%= title %></title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/player.css">
<script src="/icons.js"></script>
<script src="/theme.js"></script>
</head>
<body data-nav="player" data-room="<%= roomId %>">
<script src="/side-panel.js"></script>
<div id="app">
  <h1 class="app-title"><%- icon('logo') %><%= title %></h1>

  <div id="team-info">
    <%# The team, then which room it's in. Leaving it is the side panel's "Kambariai" (side-panel.js). %>
    <p>Komanda: <strong id="team-name"></strong></p>
    <p>Kambarys: <strong><%= roomName %></strong> (<%= roomId %>)</p>
  </div>

  <div id="quiz-area">
    <div id="quiz"></div>
    <div id="leaderboard" hidden></div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="internet-overlay" hidden>
  <div class="internet-overlay-box">
    <svg class="internet-overlay-icon" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true">
      <%# Globe (the internet), crossed out. %>
      <g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
        <circle cx="32" cy="32" r="22" />
        <ellipse cx="32" cy="32" rx="10" ry="22" />
        <path d="M10 32h44M14 21h36M14 43h36" />
      </g>
      <path d="M12 12 52 52" stroke="#1f1f1f" stroke-width="9" stroke-linecap="round" />
      <path d="M12 12 52 52" stroke="#ef4444" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" />
    </svg>
    <p class="internet-overlay-title">Išjunkite mobiliuosius duomenis</p>
    <p class="internet-overlay-text">Jūsų įrenginys turi prieigą prie interneto. Žaidimo metu internetu naudotis negalima. Išjunkite mobiliuosius duomenis, ir šis langas dings pats.</p>
    <button type="button" id="internet-recheck-btn">Patikrinti dar kartą</button>
  </div>
</div>
<script src="/socket.io/socket.io.js"></script>
<script src="/app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
